  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) is Amazon SageMaker Pipelines, which allows data scientists and developers to create, automate, and manage end-to-end machine learning workflows. This includes steps for data preparation, model training, and model deployment, making ML processes reproducible. Option B (Amazon SageMaker Model Registry) is for versioning and managing models. Option C (Amazon SageMaker Model Monitor) is for detecting drift and quality issues in deployed models. Option D (Amazon SageMaker Studio) is an IDE for ML development.',
