VALUES (
  'q_46_m_46_3_63',
  'A machine learning team needs a centralized repository to version, track, and manage different iterations of their trained models, including approval gates for production deployment. Which SageMaker feature provides this functionality?',
  'mcq',
  '["Amazon SageMaker Model Monitor","Amazon SageMaker Model Registry","Amazon SageMaker Pipelines","Amazon SageMaker Studio"]'::json,
  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) is Amazon SageMaker Model Registry, which provides a centralized repository for managing ML models. It allows for versioning, tracking model lineage, and setting up approval workflows for models before they are deployed to production. Option A (Amazon SageMaker Model Monitor) is for monitoring deployed models for drift. Option C (Amazon SageMaker Pipelines) is for automating ML workflows. Option D (Amazon SageMaker Studio) is an integrated development environment.',
