  '{2}',
  'Option C (correct) describes the primary purpose of Amazon SageMaker Model Monitor, which continuously monitors the quality of machine learning models in production. It detects issues like data drift, model quality degradation, and bias drift, triggering alerts for potential retraining needs (ap-4.4-001). Option A refers to Amazon SageMaker Pipelines. Option B refers to Amazon SageMaker Model Registry. Option D refers to Amazon SageMaker Neo.',
