  'The first step is to create a Kinesis Data Stream (Option C). During or immediately after creation, define the shard count (Option D), which determines the stream''s capacity. Once the stream is ready, configure producers (Option A) to send data to it. Finally, configure consumers (Option B) to read and process the data from the stream.',
