  '{2,3,0,1}',
  'To create an AWS Glue Data Catalog database, first navigate to the AWS Glue console (Option C). From there, select the option to create a new database (Option D). You will then need to specify the database name (Option A). After the database is created, you can proceed to add tables to it (Option B) using crawlers or manual definitions.',
