  '{2,3,0,1}',
  'The first step is to create a Kinesis Data Firehose delivery stream (Option C). During the creation process, configure the Amazon S3 destination (Option D) where the data will be stored. Next, define buffer hints and compression settings (Option A) to optimize delivery and storage. Finally, begin sending data to the Firehose stream (Option B) from your sensor applications.',
