  'The process starts by creating a Kinesis Data Firehose delivery stream (Option C). During setup, configure the Amazon S3 destination bucket (Option D) where the inference results will be stored. Once configured, the ML application can send inference results to the Firehose stream (Option A). Finally, monitor data delivery and errors (Option B) to ensure reliable data capture.',
