  '{2,3,1,0}',
  'Before creating the job, define input and output data sources (Option C) in the AWS Glue Data Catalog. Then, create an AWS Glue job (Option D) in the console or Glue Studio. Next, write the ETL script (Option B), typically in PySpark, to perform the desired transformations. Finally, run the ETL job (Option A) to execute the script and process the data.',
