  '{2,3,0,1}',
  'The first step is to upload the CSV files to Amazon S3 (Option C), as this is the data source. Next, create an AWS Glue database (Option D) in the Data Catalog to hold the metadata. Then, configure an AWS Glue crawler (Option A) to scan the S3 path where the CSV files are located. Finally, run the crawler (Option B) to discover the schema and populate the Data Catalog with table definitions.',
