VALUES (
  'q_46_m_46_2_104',
  'A media company wants to analyze images for specific objects and scenes using Amazon Rekognition. Arrange the following steps to prepare input for Amazon Rekognition image analysis.',
  'ordering',
  '["Upload the image files (e.g., JPG, PNG) to an Amazon S3 bucket.","Ensure the images meet Rekognition''s size and format requirements.","Call the appropriate Amazon Rekognition API (e.g., `detectLabels`, `detectFaces`) with the S3 object reference or image bytes.","Configure IAM permissions for the Rekognition service or calling entity to access the S3 bucket."]'::json,
  '{1,0,3,2}',
  'Before uploading, it''s crucial to ensure the data is compatible. Option B (Ensure the images meet Rekognition''s size and format requirements) is the initial data preparation step. Then, Option A (Upload the image files (e.g., JPG, PNG) to an Amazon S3 bucket) makes the images available. Option D (Configure IAM permissions for the Rekognition service or calling entity to access the S3 bucket) ensures Rekognition has the necessary access. Finally, Option C (Call the appropriate Amazon Rekognition API (e.g., `detectLabels`, `detectFaces`) with the S3 object reference or image bytes) performs the actual analysis.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain46_10',
  NOW(),
  43,
