VALUES (
  'q_46_m_46_2_105',
  'A contact center wants to transcribe customer calls using Amazon Transcribe. Arrange the following steps to prepare audio input for Amazon Transcribe.',
  'ordering',
  '["Store the audio files (e.g., WAV, MP3) in an Amazon S3 bucket.","Ensure the audio files meet Transcribe''s format, sampling rate, and channel requirements.","Configure an IAM role with permissions for Transcribe to access the S3 bucket.","Start a Transcribe transcription job, specifying the S3 input location and desired language."]'::json,
  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'The first step is to ensure the audio data is compatible with Transcribe. Option B (Ensure the audio files meet Transcribe''s format, sampling rate, and channel requirements) is a crucial prerequisite. Next, Option A (Store the audio files (e.g., WAV, MP3) in an Amazon S3 bucket) makes the audio accessible. Option C (Configure an IAM role with permissions for Transcribe to access the S3 bucket) grants the necessary permissions. Finally, Option D (Start a Transcribe transcription job, specifying the S3 input location and desired language) initiates the transcription process.',
