VALUES (
  'q_46_m_46_2_106',
  'A developer wants to convert text into lifelike speech using Amazon Polly. Arrange the following steps to prepare text input for Amazon Polly.',
  'ordering',
  '["Prepare the text content to be synthesized, ensuring it adheres to Polly''s character limits.","Choose a voice and language from the available Amazon Polly options.","Call the Amazon Polly `synthesizeSpeech` API, providing the text, voice, and output format.","Optionally, use Speech Synthesis Markup Language (SSML) to control speech aspects like pronunciation or pauses."]'::json,
  '{0,3,1,2}',
  'The process starts with the content itself. Option A (Prepare the text content to be synthesized, ensuring it adheres to Polly''s character limits) is the initial step. Option D (Optionally, use Speech Synthesis Markup Language (SSML) to control speech aspects like pronunciation or pauses) refines the text for better speech output. Option B (Choose a voice and language from the available Amazon Polly options) selects the desired vocal characteristics. Finally, Option C (Call the Amazon Polly `synthesizeSpeech` API, providing the text, voice, and output format) performs the actual text-to-speech conversion.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain46_10',
  NOW(),
  45,
  NULL,
