VALUES (
  'q_46_m_46_3_97',
  'An MLOps team wants to automate their machine learning workflow, from data processing to model deployment, using Amazon SageMaker Pipelines. Arrange the following steps for a basic SageMaker Pipeline for model training.',
  'ordering',
  '["Define a processing step to prepare the dataset.","Define a training step to train the machine learning model.","Define a model registration step to register the trained model in SageMaker Model Registry.","Create and start a SageMaker Pipeline, linking the defined steps."]'::json,
  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'A SageMaker Pipeline typically starts with data preparation. Option A (Define a processing step to prepare the dataset) is the logical first step. This is followed by the core machine learning task, Option B (Define a training step to train the machine learning model). After training, the model needs to be managed, so Option C (Define a model registration step to register the trained model in SageMaker Model Registry) comes next. Finally, Option D (Create and start a SageMaker Pipeline, linking the defined steps) orchestrates the entire workflow.',
