  '{1,4}',
  'Option B (Amazon QuickSight) is a scalable, serverless business intelligence (BI) service that enables users to easily create and publish interactive dashboards and visualizations from various data sources. Option E (Amazon Athena) is an interactive query service that makes it easy to analyze data directly in Amazon S3 using standard SQL, making it ideal for exploratory data analysis without provisioning servers. Option A (Amazon Redshift) is a data warehouse, while powerful for analytics, it''s not primarily for interactive ad-hoc querying of raw data in S3. Option C (Amazon SageMaker Studio) is an IDE for ML development, not a general-purpose data querying and visualization service. Option D (Amazon DynamoDB) is a NoSQL database, not designed for analytical querying and visualization.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain47_10',
  NOW(),
  12,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_47_3',
