VALUES (
  'q_48_m_48_1_58',
  'Which business problems are best suited for a regression model, where the objective is to predict a continuous numerical value? (Select TWO.)',
  'multiple',
  '["Predicting the temperature tomorrow in Celsius","Estimating the value of a stock at closing bell","Categorizing emails as spam or legitimate","Detecting objects within an image","Grouping similar documents into topics"]'::json,
  '{0,1}',
  'Predicting the temperature tomorrow (Option A) involves a continuous numerical output, making it a regression problem. Similarly, estimating the value of a stock (Option B) also requires predicting a continuous numerical value. Categorizing emails (Option C) and detecting objects in an image (Option D) are classification tasks. Grouping similar documents (Option E) is a clustering task, which is unsupervised learning.',
