  'The process begins by loading the dataset into the chosen analysis environment (Option C). Next, the two specific numerical variables that need to be compared are selected (Option D). These variables are then plotted on a scatter plot, with one on the X-axis and the other on the Y-axis (Option B). Finally, the scatter plot is examined to identify any visual correlations or patterns between the variables (Option A).',
