  'A machine learning team is preparing to use Amazon QuickSight for visualizing their training data stored in Amazon S3. Order the necessary steps to connect QuickSight to the data.',
  'ordering',
  '["Create a new dataset in Amazon QuickSight.","Select Amazon S3 as the data source.","Specify the S3 bucket and file path.","Grant QuickSight access to the S3 bucket."]'::json,
  '{3,0,1,2}',
  'Before QuickSight can access data in S3, it must be granted appropriate permissions to the S3 bucket (Option D). Once permissions are set, a new dataset is created within QuickSight (Option A). During dataset creation, Amazon S3 is selected as the data source (Option B). Finally, the specific S3 bucket and file path where the data resides are specified (Option C).',
