  'The process begins by loading the time series dataset into the analysis environment (Option B). It''s critical to ensure the time-related column is correctly parsed into a datetime format for proper temporal ordering (Option D). The data points are then plotted sequentially over time to create a time series chart (Option C). Finally, the plot is visually inspected to identify patterns such as trends, seasonal cycles, or unusual spikes/dips (Option A).',
