  '{1,2,0,3}',
  'Before visualizing data from Amazon S3 in Amazon QuickSight, it''s crucial to ensure the data is in a supported format (Option B). Next, proper IAM permissions must be configured to allow QuickSight to access the S3 bucket (Option C). Only then can a new dataset be created in QuickSight, pointing to the S3 location (Option A). Finally, within QuickSight, the schema and data types for the fields need to be defined to enable correct visualization and analysis (Option D). This sequence ensures data accessibility and proper interpretation.',
