  NULL,
  'Amazon QuickSight (Option A in left) is a scalable, serverless, embeddable, machine learning-powered business intelligence (BI) service that can create interactive dashboards and visualizations from various data sources, including data in Amazon S3. Amazon Athena (Option B in left) is a serverless interactive query service that makes it easy to analyze data directly in Amazon S3 using standard SQL, which is often used as a data source for QuickSight. Amazon SageMaker Data Wrangler (Option C in left) is a feature within SageMaker Studio that provides a visual interface for data preparation and feature engineering, which precedes visualization and dashboarding.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain47_10',
  NOW(),
  22,
  '{"left":["Amazon QuickSight","Amazon Athena","Amazon SageMaker Data Wrangler"],"right":["Business intelligence and dashboarding","Serverless query service for S3 data","Visual data preparation and feature engineering"]}'::json,
  '{"left":[0,1,2],"right":[0,1,2]}'::jsonb,
