  NULL,
  'Schema validation verifies that data conforms to a predefined structure and data types, preventing inconsistencies. Data type conversion aligns data formats when integrating data from different sources. Unit standardization ensures that all measurements for a particular feature are expressed in consistent units, preventing errors due to mixed units.',
  NOW(),
