  'Before deploying any new model, clear objectives are needed. Option D (Define success metrics and a hypothesis) sets the criteria for evaluation. Option B (Deploy the new model alongside the existing model) is the practical step to expose the new model to live traffic. Option A (Monitor key performance indicators (KPIs) in real-time) is crucial for observing immediate impact and gathering data. Finally, Option C (Analyze collected data for statistical significance) determines if the observed differences are meaningful.',
