  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'To categorize feedback, the categories themselves must first be established. Option B (Define the categories (e.g., ''positive'', ''negative'', ''neutral'')) sets the target labels. Option A (Collect and preprocess customer feedback text data) gathers the raw input. Option C (Label a subset of the feedback with the defined categories) creates the training data for supervised learning. Finally, Option D (Choose a classification model suitable for text data) selects the algorithm.',
