  'Order the steps for applying k-fold cross-validation during model training.',
  'ordering',
  '["Average the performance metrics across all folds","Split the training data into k equal folds","Train the model k times, each time using a different fold as the validation set","Evaluate the model on the validation fold in each iteration"]'::json,
  '{1,2,3,0}',
  'Cross-validation begins with dividing the data. Option B (Split the training data into k equal folds) creates the necessary partitions. Option C (Train the model k times, each time using a different fold as the validation set) describes the iterative training process. In each iteration, Option D (Evaluate the model on the validation fold in each iteration) assesses performance. Finally, Option A (Average the performance metrics across all folds) provides a robust estimate of the model''s performance.',
