  '{0,3,1,2}',
  'The suitability of a CNN begins with the data type. Option A (Confirm that the input data consists of images) is fundamental. Next, Option D (Determine if the problem requires high accuracy in visual pattern recognition) identifies the performance need. Option B (Assess if the task involves identifying spatial hierarchies of features) highlights a core strength of CNNs. Finally, Option C (Consider the availability of sufficient labeled image data) addresses the practical feasibility of training such a model.',
