  '{3,1,0,2}',
  'Transfer learning is particularly useful for image tasks. Option D (Confirm that the problem involves image data) is the initial check. A key driver for transfer learning is data scarcity, so Option B (Determine if there is limited labeled data) is a strong indicator. Option A (Assess if the new task''s domain is similar) ensures the pre-trained model''s learned features are relevant. Finally, Option C (Select a suitable pre-trained model) identifies the specific model to be used.',
