  '{3,1,0,2}',
  'Data preparation always starts with loading the data. Option D (Load the raw dataset) is the initial step. Next, Option B (Clean and preprocess the raw data) addresses data quality issues. Option A (Perform feature engineering and scaling) transforms the data into a suitable format for the model. Finally, Option C (Split the data into training, validation, and test sets) prepares the data for the actual training and evaluation phases.',
