  '{"A":"Image Classification","B":"Sentiment Analysis","C":"Fraud Detection"}'::json,
  NULL,
  'Image Classification (left: 0, right: 0) models need labeled image datasets to learn to categorize images. Sentiment Analysis (left: 1, right: 1) models require text data annotated with sentiment labels (e.g., positive, negative, neutral). Fraud Detection (left: 2, right: 2) models are trained on historical transaction data that is labeled to indicate fraudulent or legitimate activity.',
