  '{1,2,3,0}',
  'To connect a SageMaker notebook to a VPC, first create the Amazon VPC with appropriate subnets (Option B). Next, create a security group (Option C) to define network access rules for the notebook. Then, ensure the private subnets have routes to a NAT Gateway (Option D) if the notebook needs to access public services while remaining private. Finally, configure the SageMaker notebook instance (Option A) to launch within the specified VPC, subnets, and security group.',
