  'ordering',
  '["Define an AWS Batch job definition that references the Docker image and SageMaker training script.","Create an AWS Batch compute environment configured to use Amazon EC2 Spot Instances.","Submit AWS Batch jobs, specifying the job definition and desired parameters.","Create a Docker image containing the custom training code and dependencies, then push it to Amazon ECR."]'::json,
  '{3,1,0,2}',
  'To set up scalable and cost-effective training, first create a Docker image (Option D) with your custom training code and push it to Amazon ECR. Next, create an AWS Batch compute environment (Option B) configured to use Amazon EC2 Spot Instances. Then, define an AWS Batch job definition (Option A) that references your Docker image and SageMaker training script. Finally, submit AWS Batch jobs (Option C) using this definition, allowing Batch to manage scaling and Spot Instance usage.',
