  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To deploy a SageMaker model, first create a SageMaker Model (Option A) by pointing to the model artifacts in Amazon S3 and the Docker image for inference. Next, create a SageMaker Endpoint Configuration (Option B) to specify the compute resources (instance type and count). Then, deploy the SageMaker Endpoint (Option C) using this configuration. Finally, invoke the endpoint (Option D) with sample data to verify that it is functioning correctly and returning predictions.',
