  '{0,2,3,1}',
  'To deploy a SageMaker real-time inference endpoint, first, create an Amazon SageMaker model resource (Option A), which points to your trained model artifacts and the Docker image used for inference. Next, create an Amazon SageMaker endpoint configuration (Option C), specifying the compute resources (instance type and count) for your model. Then, create the Amazon SageMaker endpoint (Option D) itself, using the previously defined endpoint configuration. Finally, once the endpoint is in service, you can invoke it (Option B) with new data to obtain real-time predictions.',
