  'AWS CloudTrail (left 0) is crucial for recording API calls and events, providing an audit trail of actions taken within an AWS account (right 0). Amazon GuardDuty (left 1) offers intelligent threat detection by continuously monitoring for malicious activity and unauthorized behavior (right 1). AWS Security Hub (left 2) provides a comprehensive view of the security state of AWS resources, centralizing security alerts and automating compliance checks (right 2). Amazon Macie (left 3) is a data security and privacy service that uses machine learning to discover, classify, and protect sensitive data stored in Amazon S3 (right 3).',
